<%# A photograph printed in the site's two inks: shadows in bottle green, light in
    cream. The only way a photograph appears on the site, and at most one per
    view. Sources and licences: docs/redesign/IMAGE_CREDITS.md.
    Locals:
      src  (String) asset path of a greyscale image under app/assets/images
      alt  (String) what the photograph shows
      css  (String, optional) sizing classes, e.g. an aspect ratio %>
<figure class="duotone <%= local_assigns[:css] %>">
  <%= image_tag src, alt: alt, loading: "lazy", decoding: "async" %>
</figure>
